Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:10.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:12.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:14.73,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's stay a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.48,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:21.00,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not tired at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:23.16,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.80,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:30.58,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:40.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take you to a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:44.63,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Good place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:47.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay to take a detour?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.78,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.62,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Man, you're heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.36,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:56.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a fish tank at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:00:59.16,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,No, but I have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:01.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:03.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Once you get home, fill a bucket with tap water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:05.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and put it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.45,0:01:06.57,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:10.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Because tap water is rich in calcium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:20.50,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:26.46,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:30.43,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.31,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to get left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:41.71,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:45.15,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:48.73,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:53.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:55.50,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's a river!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:56.46,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:02.38,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know there was such a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.50,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Is Rin-chan here for the first time as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:09.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:12.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose it's my first summer with Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:17.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's dark and I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:20.00,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:22.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:28.49,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:30.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:23.02,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty late, but I still want to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:25.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:34.60,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,This way, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:36.21,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:37.53,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.37,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\3c&H002E41&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:44.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:58.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:10.09,Sign,Ep title,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)\fscx82.5\fscy108.75\pos(174,95)}「The Way Back Home」
